
title: AuditionRoomTable
position: 115,136
---
Table: The table the dons sit at during the auditions. You can feel their radiance radiating from it. Or did one of them pass wind?
===


title: AuditionRoomContentoNotes
position: 110,4
---
Don Contento’s notes: The notes are full of positive feedback. Almost to a sickening extent
===

title: AuditionRoomLacrimosoNotes
position: 320,8
---
Don Lacrimoso’s notes: As you read them, you feel a sense of despair wash over you, as if all joy has vanished from the world, possibly not even present to begin with. You stop reading, but you’ll never fully be the same again.
===
title: AuditionRoomCalvoNotes
position: 321,270
---
Don Calvo’s notes: It’s just “Please no one notice the toupe” over and over again.
===
title: AuditionRoomBillNotes
position: 320,139
---
Don Bill’s notes: As you read, you discover the secrets of the universe, truths you’ve always known in your heart but never truly processed in your mind, only now clicking. You fight back the urge to shed tears of sheer profundity as you finish reading
===

title: AuditionRoomEspressoNotes
position: 117,274
---
Don Espresso’s notes: These are the scribblings of a four-year-old. You question how a man such as this became the head of a major criminal organization. 
===

title: SalsBody
---
Sal’s Dead Body: The stiff of the poor son of a bitch before you. Try not to end up like him.
===

title: CandidateLog
---
Candidate Log: It’s a list of people who’ve gone before you:
Paulie Peanuts - Lasted 5 days. Asked how much more betrayal he could take upon his death
Stevie - Lasted 4 days. His Al Pacino impression upset the dons
Mikey the Imperial -  Lasted 6 days. Died from a shot to the foot
Tony Falsetto - Lasted 3 days. People were angry his life ended with a cut to black.
Sal “Big Dog” Bompanserro - Lasted 0 days. Killed Joey Calvo’s favorite clown. 
===